2013;119 months, 120&#x0002b; months); total calorie intake (continuous); intake of raw vegetables (continuous); alcohol intake (in g/day&#x02013;continuous); physical activity (vigorous, other); and education (three levels).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>